---
import { channelGroups, channelCount, siteFacts } from '../data/site';
---

<section class="section-padding relative">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-surface-950 via-surface-975 to-surface-950 pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="section-container relative z-10">
    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-4">
      <span class="gradient-text">{siteFacts.channels} 个消息渠道</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-surface-400 text-center mb-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      27 个通道均有对应适配器；按通道配置环境变量后启用，也可在编译期裁剪
    </p>

    <!-- 渠道分类 -->
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      {channelGroups.map((group) => (
        <div class="mb-6">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-400 mb-3 text-center">{group.name}</div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
            {group.channels.map((ch) => (
              <div class={`px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-mono transition-all duration-300 ${
                group.name === '国内平台'
                  ? 'bg-brand-500/10 border border-brand-500/20 text-brand-300 hover:border-brand-500/40'
                  : 'bg-surface-800/40 border border-surface-800/50 text-surface-300 hover:border-brand-500/30'
              }`}>
                {ch}
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- 一句话总结 -->
    <div class="text-center">
      <p class="text-surface-500 text-sm font-mono">
        共 {channelCount} 个通道 · 统一通道目录 · 按通道启用 · 支持编译期裁剪
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
